# Butler Routes - Dun Morogh completionist pilot (pack butler-routes-completionist, v0.5.0).
# Every Dun Morogh quest in the local census (105 quests, docs/dun-morogh-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# Coldridge Valley opens the route at the spawn camp; the class intros are gated
# per line (only Dwarf / only Gnome + only Class), profession and Camping quests
# are optional and profession-gated, and chain order is strictly turn-in-before-accept.
# Ironforge and Loch Modan turn-ins ride at the end per the Elwynn/Westfall precedent.
# Coordinates on Dun Morogh use the era frame; Ironforge and Loch Modan stops use
# the frames their data carries (era here), set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/dun-morogh
title Dun Morogh - Completionist
levels 1-12
zone Dun Morogh
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords dun morogh, completionist, coldridge, kharanos, ironforge
coords live
version 1

step Coldridge Valley — the spawn camp

  tip The spawn camp in Coldridge Valley: Sten Stoutarm (29.9, 71.2) outfits every new dwarf and gnome, Balir Frosthammer (29.7, 71.3) watches the troggs, and the class trainers stand around the campfire. Take your class intro and Dwarven Outfitters before you head out.
  accept 179 -- Dwarven Outfitters - Sten Stoutarm: eight Tough Wolf Meat from the valley wolves
  accept 1599 only Warlock -- Beginnings - Alamar Grimm: three Feather Charms off the Frostmane Novices, south
  accept 3361 -- A Refugee's Quandary - Felix Whindlebolt: his box, his chest and his bucket of bolts, out west
  accept 94373 only Shaman -- Call of Earth - Teo Hammerstorm: an Iceclaw Bear Pendant off the Frostmanes
  note Welcome! (5841) starts from a Coldridge Valley Gift Voucher; the data lists no source, so check your bags.
  accept 5841 -- Welcome! - use the Gift Voucher, then see Yori Crackhelm
  turnin 5841 -- Welcome! - Yori Crackhelm takes the voucher

step Coldridge Valley — Grelin and Talin

  tip Grelin Whitebeard (25.1, 75.7) hunts the troll cave west; Talin Keeneye (22.6, 71.4) watches the boars. Nori Pridedrift (25.0, 76.0) runs mornbrew out west.
  accept 182 -- The Troll Cave - Grelin Whitebeard: fourteen Frostmane Troll Whelps
  accept 183 -- The Boar Hunter - Talin Keeneye: twelve Small Crag Boars
  accept 3364 -- Scalding Mornbrew Delivery - Nori Pridedrift's delivery for Durnan Furcutter, back at camp
  accept 97277 -- Grund and Gozwin - Grund Drokda, by the camp: Gozwin's Mechanic's Log and a Snow Leopard Prowler, north
  complete 182 @20.2,75.9 era -- fourteen Frostmane Troll Whelps at the cave mouth
  complete 183 @19.5,75.2 era -- twelve Small Crag Boars on the western flats
  complete 179 @19.5,75.5 era -- eight Tough Wolf Meat off the valley wolves
  complete 94373 @28.7,83.1 era -- an Iceclaw Bear Pendant off the Frostmane Novices, south
  complete 97277 @27.3,62.9 era -- Gozwin's Mechanic's Log and a Snow Leopard Prowler
  turnin 97277 -- Grund and Gozwin - back to Grund Drokda
  turnin 182 -- The Troll Cave - back to Grelin Whitebeard
  turnin 183 -- The Boar Hunter - back to Talin Keeneye
  turnin 3364 -- Scalding Mornbrew Delivery - Nori's delivery to Durnan Furcutter, at camp (hurry — the mornbrew lasts five minutes)
  accept 3365 -- Bring Back the Mug - Durnan Furcutter; carry the mug back to Nori
  turnin 3365 -- Bring Back the Mug - back to Nori Pridedrift
  accept 218 -- The Stolen Journal - Grelin Whitebeard; Grik'nir the Cold has it, in the cave

