step Coldridge west — the mail run

  tip West again for the mail and the troggs: Talin takes Sten's letter, Grelin takes Talin's reply, and Balir's troggs work the flats.
  turnin 233 -- Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery - Sten's mail to Talin Keeneye
  accept 234 -- Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery - Talin's reply for Grelin Whitebeard
  turnin 234 -- Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery - back to Grelin Whitebeard
