step Coldridge exit — Thalos

  tip Out past the camp: follow Mountaineer Thalos (33.5, 71.8) down to Kharanos. Hands Springsprocket (33.9, 72.2) has supplies for Tannok Frosthammer below.
  turnin 282 -- Senir's Observations - Grelin's word to Mountaineer Thalos
  accept 96628 -- The Adventurer - Mountaineer Thalos; Eric Brighthammer in Kharanos runs the camp
  accept 420 -- Senir's Observations - Mountaineer Thalos; carry Thalos's word to Senir Whitebeard in Kharanos
  accept 2160 -- Supplies to Tannok - Hands Springsprocket's supplies for Tannok Frosthammer in Kharanos


  tip Kharanos, the valley town: Senir Whitebeard (46.7, 53.8) holds the mountaineers' hall, Innkeeper Belm (47.4, 52.5) binds your home, and Eric Brighthammer (46.7, 53.9) runs the campers' camp. Take the town's business before heading out.
