step Kharanos — class business

  tip The trainers' row: Granis Swiftaxe, Magis Sparkmantle, Hogral Bakkan and Azar Stronghammer stand around the hall, and Maxan Anvol (47.3, 52.2) tends the priests. Take what your class is offered.
  accept 1679 only Warrior -- Muren Stormpike - Granis Swiftaxe; Muren waits in Ironforge
  accept 1879 only Mage -- Speak with Bink - Magis Sparkmantle; Bink waits in Ironforge
  accept 2218 only Rogue -- Road to Salvation - Hogral Bakkan; Hulfdan Blackbeard waits in Ironforge
  accept 2997 only Dwarf,Paladin -- Tome of Divinity - Azar Stronghammer; Tiza Battleforge waits in Ironforge
  accept 5625 only Priest -- Garments of the Light - Maxan Anvol: Mountaineer Dolf, just out of town
  complete 5625 only Priest @45.8,54.6 era -- Mountaineer Dolf
  turnin 5625 only Priest -- Garments of the Light - back to Maxan Anvol
