  accept 5630 only NightElf,Priest -- Returning Home - Maxan Anvol; Priestess Alathea waits in Darnassus
  accept 94776 only Human,Priest -- Divine Grace - Maxan Anvol; High Priestess Laurena waits in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light
  accept 94824 only Gnome,Priest -- Confounding Flash - Maxan Anvol; High Priestess Mims takes it

step West of Kharanos — Shimmer Ridge

  tip The farms west of town: Marleth and Rejold Barleybrew (30.2, 45.5) brew at the western farm, Tristane Shadowstone (31.4, 44.4) watches the ridge, and Onin MacHammar (25.2, 44.5) lurks further west.
  accept 310 -- Bitter Rivals - Marleth Barleybrew; the Unguarded Thunder Ale Barrel in Kharanos settles it
  accept 312 -- Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash - Tundra MacGrann, west of the farm
