  accept 315 -- The Perfect Stout - Rejold Barleybrew: six Shimmerweed from the Frostmane Seers and their baskets
  accept 317 -- Stocking Jetsteam - Pilot Bellowfiz, at the airstrip east of town; boar meat and bear fur
  accept 2239 only Rogue -- Onin's Report - Onin MacHammar; Hulfdan Blackbeard waits in Ironforge (needs 2238, an Ironforge rogue errand outside this tracker's list — see the note below)
  note Onin's Report (2239) needs Simple Subterfugin (2238) turned in first; 2238 starts in Ironforge and is outside this tracker's list, so pick it up from the Ironforge rogue den on the way through.
  accept 98326 -- Frosthowl - Gretta Ganter (31.5, 44.6): a Sack of Fish off Frosthowl himself
  complete 315 @40.6,34.9 era -- six Shimmerweed from the baskets (and the Frostmane Seers)
