step Shimmer Ridge — the taming chain (Hunter, level 10)
  only Hunter

  tip A hunter's pets, in three tames and a lesson. Grif Wildheart (45.8, 53.0), Kharanos's hunter trainer, lends you the way: Tristane Shadowstone's path first, then a Large Crag Boar, a Snow Leopard and an Ice Claw Bear. Belia Thundergranite in Ironforge teaches the rest of the craft.
  accept 6075 -- The Hunter's Path - Tristane Shadowstone; Grif Wildheart in Kharanos takes it
  turnin 6075 -- The Hunter's Path - back to Grif Wildheart
  accept 6064 -- Taming the Beast - Grif Wildheart; tame a Large Crag Boar
  complete 6064 @35.0,54.0 era -- tame a Large Crag Boar
  turnin 6064 -- Taming the Beast - back to Grif Wildheart
  accept 6084 -- Taming the Beast - Grif Wildheart; tame a Snow Leopard
  complete 6084 @26.0,50.0 era -- tame a Snow Leopard
  turnin 6084 -- Taming the Beast - back to Grif Wildheart
  accept 6085 -- Taming the Beast - Grif Wildheart; tame an Ice Claw Bear
  complete 6085 @26.0,50.0 era -- tame an Ice Claw Bear
  turnin 6085 -- Taming the Beast - back to Grif Wildheart
  accept 6086 -- Training the Beast - Grif Wildheart; Belia Thundergranite in Ironforge takes it
  accept 6722 only NightElf -- The Hunter's Path - Grif Wildheart; Dazalar in Darnassus takes it
  note The Night Elf Hunter's Path (6722) ends with Dazalar in Darnassus, far from here; Night Elf hunters turn it in there.
  zone map 1438
  turnin 6722 only NightElf -- The Hunter's Path - Dazalar takes it, in Darnassus
  zone map 1426

