step The ranch and quarry — Gol'Bolar

  tip Gol'Bolar Quarry: Quarrymaster Thesten (69.2, 54.8) and Frast Dokner (69.0, 55.9) work the dig, Foreman Stonebrow (69.1, 56.3) and Senator Mehr Stonehallow (68.7, 56.0) hold it. The Rockjaw troggs are everywhere.
  note Stolen Blasting Powder (95213) starts from an Empty Powder Keg dropped by the Rockjaw troggs around the quarry.
  accept 95213 -- Stolen Blasting Powder - use the Empty Powder Keg, then see Quarrymaster Thesten
  turnin 95213 -- Stolen Blasting Powder - the keg to Quarrymaster Thesten
  accept 95214 -- Stolen Blasting Powder - Quarrymaster Thesten; sixteen Stolen Blasting Powder
  complete 95214 @68.0,56.0 era -- sixteen Stolen Blasting Powder off the Rockjaw Ambushers and Backbreakers
  turnin 95214 -- Stolen Blasting Powder - back to Quarrymaster Thesten
  accept 432 -- Those Blasted Troggs! - Foreman Stonebrow: six Rockjaw Skullthumpers
  complete 432 @68.0,58.0 era -- six Rockjaw Skullthumpers
  turnin 432 -- Those Blasted Troggs! - back to Foreman Stonebrow
  accept 433 -- The Public Servant - Senator Mehr Stonehallow: ten Rockjaw Bonesnappers
  complete 433 @70.5,54.0 era -- ten Rockjaw Bonesnappers
  turnin 433 -- The Public Servant - back to Senator Mehr Stonehallow

step Gol'Bolar — the quarry's smith
  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  note Blacksmiths only. Frast Dokner wants twelve Copper Bars and four Toughened Boar Hides; the data lists no Dun Morogh pickup source for Copper Bars, so have twelve in your bags before you turn in. Non-smiths skip this step cleanly.
  accept 95217 only Warrior,Paladin,Shaman -- The Quarry's Smith - Frast Dokner
  complete 95217 @70.9,61.4 era -- four Toughened Boar Hides off the Scarred Crag Boars
  turnin 95217 only Warrior,Paladin,Shaman -- The Quarry's Smith - back to Frast Dokner

