step The far east — Hammerfoot and Kadrell

  tip The tunnel road: Pilot Hammerfoot (83.9, 39.2) crashed east, Mountaineer Barleybrew (86.3, 48.8) holds the crossing, Bruegs Kindleborn (87.9, 44.8) tends the shamans' fire, and Mountaineer Kadrell (95.4, 46.5) and Thorgrum Borrelson (96.1, 47.1) hold the tunnel mouth.
  note A Pilot's Revenge (417) starts from A Dwarven Corpse by the crash site.
  accept 419 -- The Lost Pilot - Pilot Hammerfoot; his corpse lies southwest
  turnin 419 -- The Lost Pilot - at A Dwarven Corpse
  accept 417 -- A Pilot's Revenge - use the corpse's plea, then see Pilot Hammerfoot
  complete 417 @78.3,37.8 era -- Mangy Claw off Mangeclaw
  turnin 417 -- A Pilot's Revenge - the claw to Pilot Hammerfoot
  turnin 413 -- Shimmer Stout - the stout to Mountaineer Barleybrew
  accept 414 -- Stout to Kadrell - Mountaineer Barleybrew; Mountaineer Kadrell at the tunnel takes it
  accept 94465 only Shaman -- Call of Fire - Bruegs Kindleborn; Braldir Ashmantle over the Loch Modan line takes it (needs 94449, an Ironforge shaman errand outside this tracker's list — see the note below)
  note Call of Fire (94465) needs the earlier Call of Fire (94449) turned in first; 94449 starts in Ironforge and is outside this tracker's list, so pick it up from the Ironforge shaman trainer on the way through.
