step Ironforge — the mountain's business
  zone map 1455

  tip One Ironforge trip closes the zone: Barin, Muren, Muiredon, Hulfdan, Tiza, Bink, Rohan, Mims, Belia, Golnir and Magni all wait in the city, with the profession trainers beside them. Laurena waits in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light and Alathea and Dazalar in Darnassus; their lines turn in there.
